<Base title="About — BOSS KG" description="BOSS KG is an independent gaming brand covering video games, the MCU and the biggest moments in gaming.">
  <main class="wrap">
    <article class="article">
      <div class="a-head"><h1>About BOSS KG</h1></div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          <strong>BOSS KG</strong> is an independent gaming brand built for players who love
          video games, the Marvel Cinematic Universe, and the biggest moments in gaming.
          We make 4K 60fps HDR gameplay and walkthroughs, cut the best clips for socials, and
          write fast, no-nonsense coverage of the news that actually matters to fans.
        </p>
        <h2>What we do</h2>
        <p>
          Our team plays through the biggest single-player games and shares full walkthroughs,
          highlights and reactions across YouTube, TikTok, Instagram and Facebook. On this site
          we round up and explain the day's gaming and MCU news so you can get caught up
          in a couple of minutes.
        </p>
        <h2>Independent &amp; fan-run</h2>
        <p>
          BOSS KG is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Marvel, Sony
          Interactive Entertainment, Insomniac Games, or any publisher or studio we cover. All
          game and film titles, characters and imagery belong to their respective owners and
          appear here only for editorial commentary and coverage. See our
          <a href="/editorial-standards">Editorial Standards</a> for how we source and credit.
        </p>
        <h2>Say hello</h2>
        <p>
          Business enquiries, tips or corrections? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a> or
          <a href="/follow">follow us</a> on your platform of choice.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
